% Vertical stack (lat type 9): plug / fuel / plenum, then a square lattice
% of that column. lat 9 syntax: lat U 9 X0 Y0 NL Z1 U1 Z2 U2 ...
pin pf
UO2    0.40
Zirc   0.45
water
pin pp
Zirc   0.45
water
pin pe
steel  0.45
water

lat col 9 0.0 0.0 3
  0.0   pe
  5.0   pf
 45.0   pp

lat core 1 0.0 0.0 2 2 1.26
col col
col col

surf outer cuboid -1.26 1.26 -1.26 1.26 0.0 55.0
cell world 0 fill core -outer
cell grave 0 outside outer

mat UO2   -10.4 92235.80c 0.04 92238.80c 0.96 8016.80c 2.0
mat Zirc  -6.55 40090.80c 1.0
mat steel -8.0  26056.80c 1.0
mat water -0.74 1001.80c 2.0 8016.80c 1.0
set pop 200 20 50
